<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="EFU Goods Traders privacy policy."><section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p>Last updated: 28 August 2026</p></div></section><section class="section"><article class="container legal"><h2>Information we collect</h2><p>When you submit an enquiry, EFU may collect your name, company, contact details, country, selected service and the project information you provide.</p><h2>How information is used</h2><p>The information is used to respond to enquiries, prepare quotations, coordinate project discussions and maintain necessary business records.</p><h2>Sharing and retention</h2><p>Information should only be shared with personnel or service providers necessary to process the enquiry and should be retained only as long as reasonably required for business or legal purposes.</p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>You may contact EFU to request access, correction or deletion of personal information, subject to applicable legal obligations.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For privacy enquiries, contact <a class="text-link" href="mailto:sales@efutraders.com">sales@efutraders.com</a>. This policy should be reviewed by the client’s legal adviser before launch.</p></article></section></BaseLayout>
